Parameters: {"email": "Required. string. The email address of the new user.", "password": "Required. string. The password for the new user.", "firstName": "Required. string. The first name of the new user.", "lastName": "Required. string. The last name of the new user.", "groupId": "integer. The ID of the group to add the user to."}
Output: The newly created user object, including their ID, email, first name, last name, and group membership.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: Object{id, email, firstName, lastName, groupId}

Function_Description.updatePermissions:
Update permissions and access levels for a user or group.
Parameters: {"userId": "integer. The ID of the user to update permissions for.", "groupId": "integer. The ID of the group to update permissions for.", "permissions": "Required. Object. A JSON object containing the new permissions and access levels."}
Output: A confirmation message indicating the permissions have been successfully updated.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: Object{message}

